   Expected, as measured on the base and on this exact patch: only `ai::skill::r747000_mid_skill_mixes_and_reproduces`, with 2× `WORLDS 1/3` and 2× `WORLDS 2/3`, the same before and after. That test runs on a 60-node budget by design.

   Any other line means `per_finalist` (`decide.rs` ~line 444) must grow: stop and report it, and do not guess a size. Then **remove the `eprintln!`**. `git diff -- crates/ai/src/decide.rs` must be empty.

7. **`spec/09-architecture.md`, §9.9, the bullet starting `- **The opponent's reply.**`.** After its second sentence ("…and the line is scored at the start of the AI's next turn.") insert:
   `A line found on one determinization is played again on each of the others; where one of the AI's own prompts there does not offer the line's answer (each world draws its own Discover), the AI answers that prompt as it would ahead and plays on, so every finalist is scored after the reply on every world.`

8. **`docs/polish/3-ai.md`.**

