|---|---|---|
| `apps/web/src/game/Hero.tsx` | change | new `UsedMark` and `usedTitle`; both power tags and `PowerButton` use them; header comment |
| `apps/web/src/game/board.css` | change | `[data-used="true"]` rules for `.power-button` and `.power-tag`; new `.power-used` |
| `apps/web/src/game/Board.tsx` | change | new `restingFatigue` helper; `Pile` title; `Seat` renders the resting badge; import `noticeTestid` |
